Package: hotspots
Type: Package
Title: Hot and Cold Spot Detection by Iterative Eigenvector Spatial Filtering
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yandira", "Cuvero", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "yandira.cuvero@gmail.com"),
    person("Rowan", "Cherodian", role = "aut"),
    person("Jorge", "Mateu", role = "aut"),
    person("Carlos", "Almeida", role = "aut"))
Description: Reconstructs a sparse spatial graph from the eigenvectors selected by
    Moran's I Lasso (MI-Lasso), labels cells as hot or cold using the fitted
    spatial component, and produces a budget-constrained priority list.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    glmnet (>= 4.1),
    igraph (>= 1.5),
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
